{'symbol': 'LUV', 'date': '2022-01-31 18:04:00', 'title': "SOUTHWEST AIRLINES EARNS TOP SCORE ON HUMAN RIGHTS CAMPAIGN FOUNDATION'S 2022 CORPORATE EQUALITY INDEX", 'text': "DALLAS, JAN. 31, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO. (NYSE: LUV) PROUDLY ANNOUNCED THAT IT RECEIVED A SCORE OF 100 ON THE HUMAN RIGHTS CAMPAIGN FOUNDATION'S 2022 CORPORATE EQUALITY INDEX (CEI), THE NATION'S FOREMOST BENCHMARKING SURVEY AND REPORT MEASURING CORPORATE POLICIES AND PRACTICES RELATED TO LGBTQ+ WORKPLACE EQUALITY.\xa0SOUTHWEST AIRLINES® JOINS THE RANKS OF OVER 840 MAJOR U.S. BUSINESSES THAT ALSO EARNED TOP MARKS THIS YEAR."}